[22.035, "o", "- Installing local/providers/mycloud v0.1.0...\r\n"]
[22.078, "o", "- Installed local/providers/mycloud v0.1.0 (unauthenticated)\r\n"]
[22.121, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.164, "o", "OpenTofu has created a lock file .terraform.lock.hcl to record the provider\r\n"]
[22.207, "o", "selections it made above. Include this file in your version control repository\r\n"]
[22.25, "o", "so that OpenTofu can guarantee to make the same selections by default when\r\n"]
[22.293, "o", "you run \"tofu init\" in the future.\r\n"]
[22.336, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.379, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.422, "o", "Warning: Additional provider information from registry\r\n"]
[22.465, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.508, "o", "The remote registry returned warnings for local/providers/mycloud:\r\n"]
[22.551, "o", "- Provider local/providers/mycloud has an unspecified (0.0.0) version available in the filesystem mirror, source at\r\n"]
[22.594, "o", "\u2026/plugins. It will not be used. \r\n"]
[22.637, "o", "If the version 0.0.0 is intended to represent a non-published provider, consider using dev_overrides -\r\n"]
[22.68, "o", "https://opentofu.org/docs/cli/config/config-file/#development-overrides-for-provider-developers\r\n"]
[22.723, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.766, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.809, "o", "Warning: Incomplete lock file information for providers\r\n"]
[22.852, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.895, "o", "Due to your customized provider installation methods, OpenTofu was forced to calculate lock file checksums locally for\r\n"]
[22.938, "o", "the following providers:\r\n"]
[22.981, "o", "  - local/providers/mycloud\r\n"]
[23.024, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.067, "o", "The current .terraform.lock.hcl file only includes checksums for darwin_arm64, so OpenTofu running on another platform\r\n"]
[23.11, "o", "will fail to install these providers.\r\n"]
[23.153, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.196, "o", "To calculate additional checksums for another platform, run:\r\n"]
[23.239, "o", "  tofu providers lock -platform=linux_amd64\r\n"]
[23.282, "o", "(where linux_amd64 is the platform to generate)\r\n"]
[23.324, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.367, "o", "OpenTofu has been successfully initialized!\r\n"]
[23.41, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.453, "o", "You may now begin working with OpenTofu. Try running \"tofu plan\" to see\r\n"]
[23.496, "o", "any changes that are required for your infrastructure. All OpenTofu commands\r\n"]
[23.539, "o", "should now work.\r\n"]
[23.582, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.625, "o", "If you ever set or change modules or backend configuration for OpenTofu,\r\n"]
[23.668, "o", "rerun this command to reinitialize your working directory. If you forget, other\r\n"]
[23.711, "o", "commands will detect it and remind you to do so if necessary.\r\n"]
[23.754, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.797, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mtofu apply -auto-approve\u001b[0m\r\n"]
